            "char_start": 367,
            "char_end": 686,
            "byte_start": 367,
            "byte_end": 687,
            "text": "Every processed passage and proposed conclusion has status **candidate for review**, with **Exploratory · outside MPLPB-approved evidence.** Eligible-original endpoints carry their own citation and profile status. An exact copy, synonym, reference or correction candidate never transfers approval to processed material."
          },
          "review_status": "not_displayed_for_this_query",
          "candidate_links": [],
          "unresolved_references": []
        },
        {
          "node_id": "node:f3dd9098f86de0882f2d5af959fcd7f14f76c900908dba832d35d1eed9e8c15b",
          "occurrence_id": "node:57d5258b4f26c7a3b8ffcb2123b64a6645111a59a4b6caf6e925dac6148e9bf1",
          "span": {
            "source_id": "source:9792e7513ee2d54a2c8c5e4ce8230f1cb6b7866501af13c72acb49407ffb796a",
            "source_sha256": "sha256:071ab79efc9ebf996702ee4f8398612f395307258b5f295d0d9b1b2e239a1e30",
            "path": "repo/docs/CANDIDATE_REVIEW_WORKSPACE.md",
            "char_start": 688,
            "char_end": 1069,
            "byte_start": 689,
            "byte_end": 1070,
            "text": "```sh\npython -m mplpb_work.sorter sort PROCESSED --mode compare --output SORTER.json\npython -m mplpb_work.candidate_workspace build SORTER.json --processed PROCESSED --originals LEDGER --question 'Who wrote the Redwood memorandum?' --output REVIEW.json\npython -m mplpb_work.candidate_workspace peruse SORTER.json --processed PROCESSED --originals LEDGER --workspace REVIEW.json\n```"
          },
          "review_status": "not_displayed_for_this_query",
