            "char_end": 7174,
            "byte_start": 5918,
            "byte_end": 7175,
            "text": "[Workspace controls](../tests/test_candidate_workspace.py) cover all three owner outcomes, missing body support, processed contradictions, processed-only topics, quoted/conditional corrections, unresolved targets, Unicode/entity byte mapping, permission/integrity changes, forged promotion, separate budgets, CLI replay and H05 preservation. The initial workspace completed22 native replays unchanged and five public-source demonstrations, and passed1265 extracted-ZIP tests. A later disconnected-word control reproduced an unwanted broad lexical suggestion; its outputs and failure are retained. The conservative version uses existing four-word phrase observations. That trial passed1266 tests but a new positive phrase control and installed-wheel check exposed separate omissions, retained in its [report](../evaluation/candidate-review-workspace/2026-11-18-conservative/REPORT.md). The runtime repair passes both the positive and disconnected-word controls and an isolated installed-wheel smoke; its new frozen full execution is pending. The earlier [four-arm study](../evaluation/sorter-first-originals/2026-11-18-witness-admission-final/REPORT.md) remains frozen at2/22 complete answers. Independent human and unseen-original evaluation remain NOT RUN."
