            "path": "repo/docs/PASSAGE_ADMISSION.md",
            "char_start": 62,
            "char_end": 370,
            "byte_start": 62,
            "byte_end": 370,
            "text": "`mplpb_answers/passage_admission.py` assigns atomic source-witness sets to existing native question parts. The existing `documentary_verify.py` remains byte unchanged and independently checks admitted proposals against eligible originals. Admission does not establish truth, event identity or a relationship."
          },
