          "occurrence_id": "node:ab9a992a745b4dab5508bb526ed3914594e01e4f1d1c5ef4b189d99430a83887",
          "span": {
            "source_id": "source:91a8e0141aeb222f8fca1eb3baf0958581d4012ca5ac405f96f9d6364f39e502",
            "source_sha256": "sha256:2501dd1b1751693d82088d8bad0096697f4b0dec3f151c596a5d240145508eeb",
            "path": "repo/docs/PASSAGE_ADMISSION.md",
            "char_start": 1630,
            "char_end": 1984,
            "byte_start": 1630,
            "byte_end": 1984,
            "text": "Relevant contrary evidence remains subject to the existing independent scan. If a necessary competing witness cannot fit, completion is withheld and the budget limitation is reported. Admission metadata includes exact admitted passages, reader roles, deduplication, blocked locators and review-only hints. Unadmitted candidates are explicitly unverified."
