            "char_end": 2357,
            "byte_start": 1986,
            "byte_end": 2357,
            "text": "H05 is a development regression fixture, not a production routing exception. Its pilot recovered the same four Declaration source spans (4070 characters) at the original12-passage/8000-character limit despite high Darwin search hints. Generic two-part proofs, duplicate charging and over-budget counterevidence have separate controls in `tests/test_witness_admission.py`."
