            "char_start": 2359,
            "char_end": 3001,
            "byte_start": 2359,
            "byte_end": 3001,
            "text": "The frozen historical baseline remains2 complete answers out of22. The goal is22 correct outcomes: complete cited answers when established, or well-supported conflict/refusal where justified by originals. Generic retrieval, grammar and budget failures are not automatically correct. Complete-answer counts remain separate. The [final frozen study](../evaluation/sorter-first-originals/2026-11-18-witness-admission-final/REPORT.md) completes88 workers with2/22 complete answers and27/32 draft spans in every arm; no new complete-answer gain. All1249 extracted-ZIP regressions pass. Independent human and unseen-original evaluation are NOT RUN."
